@page "/help"
@inject NavigationManager Nav

<header class="sticky">
    <h2>Mage 🧙‍♂️<sub> A Scorekeeping app for Wizard</sub></h2>

</header>
<div class="HelpPage">
    <h3>How to Use</h3>
    <p>First, Buy & Play <a href="https://www.usgamesinc.com/Cards_and_Games/wizard-card-games/original-wizard-r-card-game.html" target="_blank">Original Wizard® Card Game</a></p>
    <p>On the <button>🏠</button> Home Screen, start a <button class="primary">New Game</button></p>
    <p>
        On the new game screen, enter the names and initials for 3 to 6 players. Select which player will be the dealer for the first round.  
        Each successive new game you start, the previous game will be copied but the first dealer will be advanced by one.
        You can use <button>⟲</button> Reset if you want to start fresh.

    </p>
    <p>The "Game In Progress" screen shows the details for the current round.</p>
    <div class="bid-cards">
        <div class="dealer bid-card">
            <b><span class="">This is the dealer</span></b>
        </div>
        <div class="first bid-card">
            <b><span class="">This is the starting player</span></b>
        </div>
        <div class="bid-card">
            <b><span class="">This player made their bid</span></b><!--!--><br>
            <button class="selectedSuccess">😊</button>
        </div>

        <div class="bid-card">
            <b><span class="">This player did not.</span></b><!--!--><br>
            <button class="ToggleSuccess"><!--!-->😊</button><!--!-->
            <button class="selectedFail"><!--!-->☹️</button>
        </div>
        <div class="bid-card">
            <b><span class="">Before you start playing, put the player's bid here</span></b><!--!--><br>
            <input type="number" min="0" max="3" placeholder="Bid" style="box-shadow: 0 0 50px 15px #48abe0;">
            <button class="ToggleSuccess">😊</button>
        </div>
        <div class="bid-card">
            <b><span class="">If the player missed their bid, put <u>how many tricks they took</u> here</span></b><!--!--><br>
            <button class="selectedFail"><!--!-->☹️</button>
            <input type="number" min="1" max="3" placeholder="Took" style="box-shadow: 0 0 50px 15px #48abe0;">
        </div>


    </div>
    <p>Bids and Tricks Taken by each player must be between 0 and the round number. You must select success or failure for each player.  Total tricks taken
        has to equal the round number.  After the bids are validated, you can press <button class="primary">Next Round</button> to move on or 
        <button class="primary">Game Over</button> if it's the last round. The scores will be automatically calculated.  You can see the bids, points, and scores for each round
        on the <button>🧮</button> score sheet page.
    </p>
</div>


<footer class="sticky">
    <button @onclick=@(() => Nav.NavigateTo("./"))>🏠</button>

</footer>

